[{"source": "tests", "severity": "note", "category": "coverage-gap", "title": "W9 surge re-pin's campus floor is existence-only — the campus share of the doubled ask is measured, not pinned", "location": "core/demand_test.odin:727", "evidence": "core/demand_test.odin (test_w9_surge_lands_under_caps):\n\ttesting.expectf(t, campuses >= 1, \"the honest surge floor requires a campus to exist (got %d) — a campus-silent pass is a regression\", campuses)\n\ttesting.expectf(t, campus_window_spawns > 0, \"the honest surge floor requires a campus to SOURCE in the window (got %d in-window campus spawns)\", campus_window_spawns)\n\ttesting.expectf(t, stream_spawned >= MIN_LAND,\n\t\t\"W9 FAIL: the surge must LAND — in-window streaming spawns %d < %d (the honest doubled ask × 0.95: 2 streaming entries × 10 × %d ticks); the capped map cannot source the surge\", stream_spawned, MIN_LAND, WINDOW)\n\nPR body claim: \"and the campus half lands fully (measured 100%)\" — disclosed as a measurement. The only share-level pin lives in the no-growth test (demand_test.odin:500: testing.expectf(t, total_campus >= W*9/10, ...)).", "detail": "In the W9 grown-mesh run, hosts (8 seeded at cap 2/tick + growth-born) can absorb most of the 20/tick ask, so a regression dropping campus in-window sourcing to a trickle passes all W9 asserts; only the controlled no-growth class-profiles run pins the flood share.", "recommended_fix": "Add a campus-share floor inside the surge window, e.g. campus_window_spawns >= (10*WINDOW)*9/10 or >= stream_spawned/3, so a growth-context campus under-landing fails the pin."}, {"source": "tests", "severity": "note", "category": "coverage-gate", "title": "Advisory test gate: PASS", "location": "N/A", "evidence": "Verified: live catalog fold recomputed from data/*.json = 17d3baf8c6e1df7f, matching all 35 goldens/*.t1 headers; git-recomputed fold chain 66c4324a06058860 (aec3c88) → 250679b1940fb87b (11c6cf6) → 17d3baf8c6e1df7f (d0c2c38) matches the PR body; d0c2c38 data delt